{"format_version":"vbulletin-3+-thread","url":"https://forum.theonyxpath.com/forum/main-category/main-forum/the-classic-world-of-darkness/vampire-the-masquerade/1416192-protection-vs-scrying","id":1416192,"title":"Protection vs Scrying","path":["Home","Onyx Path","White Wolf Worlds","World of Darkness","Vampire: The Masquerade"],"posts":[{"date":"2020-09-30T18:42:16-07:00","id":1416192,"title":"Protection vs Scrying","content":"One of the PCs in my current game is a Tremere, and I was wondering how many rituals exist to protect someone from thaumaturgical/Auspex-based surveillance? <br /> <br /> Is the Archon pretty much screwed if the Tremere Anarch gets something with a psychic connection to him, like a handwritten note? <br /> <br /> I am aware of both Sanctuary, the lvl 5 Thaum ritual, and Din of the Damned, the lvl 1 Necromancy ritual (which doesn't say it protects vs visual surveillance, but i might rule that it does just for ease of use)<br /> <br /> Anything else coming to mind for y'all?","signature":"","edited":{"userid":0,"user_link":"","user":"","date":""},"attachments":[],"reactions":[],"user":{"link":"https://forum.theonyxpath.com/member/25404-justanothercaitiff","name":"JustAnotherCaitiff","avatar":"https://forum.theonyxpath.com/core/avatars/0/0/6/0/4/5/avatar25404_2.jpeg","title":"Member","rank":0,"rank-name":"","custom":[{"key":"Join Date:","value":"Jun 2019"},{"key":"Posts:","value":"21"}]},"thankedby":[]},{"date":"2020-10-01T00:05:39-07:00","id":1416214,"title":"","content":"<div class=\"bbcode_container\"> <div class=\"bbcode_quote\"> <div class=\"quote_container\"> <div class=\"bbcode_quote_container b-icon b-icon__ldquo-l--gray\"></div> <div class=\"bbcode_postedby\"> Originally posted by <strong>JustAnotherCaitiff</strong> <a href=\"https://forum.theonyxpath.com/forum/main-category/main-forum/the-classic-world-of-darkness/vampire-the-masquerade/1416192-protection-vs-scrying#post1416192\" rel=\"nofollow\" title=\"View Post\" class=\"b-icon b-icon__double-arrow-right--blue animate-scroll\">View Post</a> </div> <div class=\"message\">Is the Archon pretty much screwed if the Tremere Anarch gets something with a psychic connection to him, like a handwritten note?</div> </div> </div> </div>Kinda, but I'll point out that in the modern world electronic surveillance exists and the requirements to use it are on par with the thaumaturgic means.<br /> <br /> Personally, I would not let you scry through a note, unless it's like a love letter. Go with something more personal and dramatically significant, instead of rewarding paranoid dumpster diving. Actively recommend the player what to steal for scrying on the Archon, so that they feel rewarding for thinking to use their power, instead of feeling like they've been cockblocked and given unreasonable demands.<br /> <br /> Also as a general rule I'd say that &quot;Ward against X&quot; prevents the X type from using their power across the ward, so sitting in a Warding Circle Against Kindred would keep you safe from being scryed or dominated.","signature":"","edited":{"userid":0,"user_link":"","user":"","date":""},"attachments":[],"reactions":[],"user":{"link":"https://forum.theonyxpath.com/member/12892-kammerer","name":"Kammerer","avatar":"https://forum.theonyxpath.com/core/avatars/0/0/6/0/4/5/avatar12892_2.jpeg","title":"Member","rank":5,"rank-name":"","custom":[{"key":"Join Date:","value":"Jan 2017"},{"key":"Posts:","value":"1191"}]},"thankedby":[]},{"date":"2020-10-01T03:33:00-07:00","id":1416221,"title":"","content":"With this it might also be worth putting in the concept the mystic half life, that the longer the item is away from the person the less of an arcane connection it is. Also have the potency of the connection established by how significant the item is to the person who owns/created it.<br /> <br /> So with the hand written note - written on normal paper, and using a regular pen and ink<br /> - if it's to ask some one to meet them at 10pm the next night, the writer concentrated for only a few moments on the note, then very low potency, and dissipates in seconds.<br /> - if it's a heart felt note, that has take hours to get the words right, and multiple drafts, then much more potent, and will last longer.<br /> <br /> best to steal some part of them<br />","signature":"","edited":{"userid":0,"user_link":"","user":"","date":""},"attachments":[],"reactions":[],"user":{"link":"https://forum.theonyxpath.com/member/26145-babi_gog","name":"babi_gog","avatar":"https://forum.theonyxpath.com/core/avatars/0/0/6/0/4/5/avatar26145_2.jpeg","title":"Member","rank":5,"rank-name":"","custom":[{"key":"Join Date:","value":"May 2020"},{"key":"Posts:","value":"94"}]},"thankedby":[]},{"date":"2020-10-01T04:09:54-07:00","id":1416226,"title":"","content":"iirc, V20 had a sabbat ritual (or ritae) that prevented intrusions from psychic projection and ghosts and maybe spirits as well<br /> <br /> you can probably use spirit guardian if you want to guard against psychic projection<br /> <br /> I'm not sure what you mean by psychic connection,<br /> all I know is you can use something that's tied to the target to use thaumaturgy on them at a distance,<br /> my memory isn't clear on this, but I believe it's limited to thaumaturgic rituals, so auspex and thaum paths may not work (I'll have to check)","signature":"<hr class=\"b-divider\"/><br/><b>-</b>","edited":{"userid":0,"user_link":"","user":"","date":""},"attachments":[],"reactions":[],"user":{"link":"https://forum.theonyxpath.com/member/10998-pleiades","name":"Pleiades","avatar":"https://forum.theonyxpath.com/core/avatars/0/0/6/0/4/5/avatar10998_2.jpeg","title":"Member","rank":5,"rank-name":"","custom":[{"key":"Join Date:","value":"Jan 2016"},{"key":"Posts:","value":"1844"}]},"thankedby":[]},{"date":"2020-10-02T02:23:42-07:00","id":1416457,"title":"","content":"Well this is kind of why the Tremere clan tends to hunt down rogue members. Thaumaturgy is a real pain to counter without specialists, But an Archon has the authority to just request such a specialist from the Tremere clan. The clan would prioritize this if for no other reason than to protect clan secrets. When it comes to the Tremere, it is best to think about how the entire power structure reacts to the character, not just the random archon.<br /> <br /> Also was this anarch something special to begin with? Being trained in mystic surveillance is practically a specialty, considering how much xp you need for Auspex, Thaumaturgy, and access to the correct rituals. If some one like that went rogue, kill squads would be chasing him. If this specialist was sired by another anarch tremere and then trained to this degree and the clan found out about it...... I think an Archon is the least of your worries.","signature":"","edited":{"userid":0,"user_link":"","user":"","date":""},"attachments":[],"reactions":[],"user":{"link":"https://forum.theonyxpath.com/member/727-thoth","name":"Thoth","avatar":"https://forum.theonyxpath.com/core/avatars/0/0/6/0/4/5/avatar727_2.jpeg","title":"Banned","rank":5,"rank-name":"","custom":[{"key":"Join Date:","value":"Nov 2013"},{"key":"Posts:","value":"1689"}]},"thankedby":[]}]}